      "commit_message_full": "H6-REPAIR-CLOSE-01: verifier package V2 + final evidence (NOT_EXECUTED)\n\nExternal Verifier Package V2 from git objects (ee58c7a):\n - H6_EXTERNAL_VERIFIER_PACKAGE_V2.json/md + H6_EXTERNAL_VERIFIER_PROMPT_V2.md\n - all SHAs from git show bytes (spec 221cfa1d, manifest 5f9aba44,\n   rationale 25aba49b, whitelist e5383fa6, dataset 16779b7, price e1c2462)\n - 8-defect reverify matrix (EXT-DATA/PRICE/PIT/CONS/CONS-002/CONS-004/CONF/FULL-HERMETIC)\n - test commands (PIT 12, OI 28, audit 60/60, 20x flake, full hermetic)\n\nEvidence:\n - H6_EXTERNAL_DEFECT_REGRESSION_MATRIX_V2.json finalized (7 PASS + 1 LIMITATION_EXPLICIT, full-hermetic now PASS 1299/0\u00d72 + 20/20)\n - H6_SELF_VERIFICATION_V2.json refreshed to 32/32 PASS (added full_hermetic + flake checks)\n - H6_PREREG_COMMIT_RECORD_V2.json (post-commit annotation, not prereg semantics)\n - RUN_REPORT.{md,json} + FINAL_REPORT.md alias (PENDING_EXTERNAL_REVERIFICATION)\n\nH6_EXECUTIONS=0 H6_BACKTESTS=0 PERFORMANCE_OBSERVED=false FALSE_SUCCESS=0\nH6_PREREG_COMMIT_V2 ee58c7a unchanged (git diff still EMPTY for SPEC/MANIFEST)\nH6_INDEPENDENT_VERIFICATION_V2 = PENDING (builder cannot certify itself)\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>\n",
